<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 625.66 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 625.66 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were heavy buyers of South African bonds on Friday, snapping up a net 625.66 million rand worth after buying 39.11 million rand on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
